# Arguments for the limut HUB75 display. Installed to /etc/default/limut-hub75.
#
# --size must match the panel array as the 5A-75B is configured to drive it.
# --gamma 1 is what draw/hub75/pi/pixel-check.js needs; 2.2 is the running value.

# The bench setup as verified 2026-08-29: one P5 64x32 module on J1, on a card configured for a
# 1280x512 canvas and 1/32 scan. See draw/hub75/CLAUDE.md for where every number comes from.
HUB75_ARGS=--name hub75-01 --output colorlight --iface eth0 --size 64x32 --canvas 1280x256 --offset 1088,0 --row-map 2 --panel-rows 32 --color-order bgr --gamma 2.2
